BT /F1 16 Tf 48 790 Td (rate-sentinel ? Product Requirements Document \(PRD\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 756 Td (> **Version:** 1.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; **Status:** Draft &nbsp;|&nbsp; **Author:** Prashant Verma) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 740 Td (> **Related BRD:** [rate-sentinel-BRD.md]\(rate-sentinel-BRD.md\) &nbsp;|&nbsp; **Domain:**) Tj (Platform Engineering ∑ FinTech / Mobility) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 696 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 666 Td (Table of Contents) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 634 Td (1. [Product Overview]\(#1-product-overview\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 618 Td (2. [Goals & Non-Goals]\(#2-goals--non-goals\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 602 Td (3. [User Stories]\(#3-user-stories\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 586 Td (4. [Functional Requirements]\(#4-functional-requirements\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 570 Td (   - [FR-1 Rate Limiting]\(#fr-1-rate-limiting\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 554 Td (   - [FR-2 Authentication & Authorization]\(#fr-2-authentication--authorization\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 538 Td (   - [FR-3 OTP Verification]\(#fr-3-otp-verification\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 522 Td (   - [FR-4 Payment Processing]\(#fr-4-payment-processing\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 506 Td (   - [FR-5 Notification Dispatch]\(#fr-5-notification-dispatch\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 490 Td (   - [FR-6 Admin Rule Management]\(#fr-6-admin-rule-management\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 474 Td (   - [FR-7 Observability & Metrics]\(#fr-7-observability--metrics\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 458 Td (5. [Non-Functional Requirements]\(#5-non-functional-requirements\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 442 Td (6. [API Contract Summary]\(#6-api-contract-summary\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 426 Td (7. [Data Models]\(#7-data-models\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 410 Td (8. [Error Handling Standards]\(#8-error-handling-standards\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 394 Td (9. [Dependencies]\(#9-dependencies\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 378 Td (10. [Acceptance Criteria Summary]\(#10-acceptance-criteria-summary\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 362 Td (11. [Open Questions]\(#11-open-questions\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 332 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 302 Td (1. Product Overview) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 270 Td (**rate-sentinel** is a centralised API gateway and access-control platform built on Java 17) Tj (and Spring Boot 3. It sits at the entry point of all platform API calls and enforces:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 226 Td (- **Rate limiting** ? pluggable algorithm-based throttling per client and route) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 210 Td (- **Authentication** ? stateless JWT-based identity verification) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 194 Td (- **OTP verification** ? secure, multi-channel client identity confirmation) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 178 Td (- **Payment processing** ? idempotent transaction handling with MySQL persistence) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 162 Td (- **Notification dispatch** ? async Kafka event publishing for downstream delivery) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 132 Td (It publishes all notification events to Kafka topics consumed by **message-relay**.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 102 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 72 Td (2. Goals & Non-Goals) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 40 Td (Goals) Tj ET
endstream
