BT /F1 11 Tf 48 790 Td (- Prevent API abuse through configurable, live-updatable rate limiting) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 774 Td (- Provide a single, secure OTP service with consistent lockout policy across all consumer) Tj (services) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 744 Td (- Guarantee exactly-once payment processing using idempotency keys) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 728 Td (- Decouple business logic from notification delivery via Kafka event publishing) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 712 Td (- Expose operational metrics for real-time monitoring via Prometheus) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 682 Td (Non-Goals) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 667 Td (- Delivering notifications to end customers \(owned by message-relay\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 651 Td (- User registration and account management) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 635 Td (- OAuth2 / OIDC flows) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 619 Td (- Payment refunds or chargebacks) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 603 Td (- Multi-region active-active deployment \(v1.0\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 573 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 543 Td (3. User Stories) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 511 Td (| ID | As a? | I want to? | So that? |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 495 Td (|---|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 479 Td (| US-01 | Platform operator | Update rate limit rules live without restarting the service |) Tj (I can respond to abuse incidents immediately |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 449 Td (| US-02 | Client application | Receive a clear `429` when I exceed my quota | I know when to) Tj (back off and retry |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 419 Td (| US-03 | Client application | Generate and verify an OTP for my user | I can confirm) Tj (identity before sensitive operations |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 389 Td (| US-04 | Client application | Submit a payment with an idempotency key | Retrying on) Tj (network failure never double-charges my user |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 359 Td (| US-05 | Platform operator | See rate limit hit rates and OTP metrics in Grafana | I can) Tj (monitor platform health without querying the database |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 329 Td (| US-06 | Security officer | Have all secrets managed in Azure Key Vault | No credentials) Tj (are exposed in source code or logs |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 299 Td (| US-07 | Downstream service | Publish a notification intent and forget | I never own vendor) Tj (logic, retry logic, or delivery state |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 269 Td (| US-08 | Client application | Know exactly how many requests I have remaining | I can) Tj (implement smart client-side throttling |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 225 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 195 Td (4. Functional Requirements) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 163 Td (---) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 133 Td (FR-1 Rate Limiting) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 104 Td (#### FR-1.1 ? Algorithm selection per rule) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 88 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 58 Td (The system must support three rate-limiting algorithms, selectable per rate limit rule:) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
