BT /F1 11 Tf 48 776 Td (| Algorithm | Mechanism | Redis Structure | Best For |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 760 Td (|---|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 744 Td (| `SLIDING_WINDOW` | Rolling window using sorted set; removes stale entries on each request) Tj (| Sorted set \(`ZSET`\) keyed by `sw:{clientId}:{route}` | Accuracy, no boundary burst |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 714 Td (| `TOKEN_BUCKET` | Bucket refilled at fixed rate; consume one token per request | Two keys:) Tj (`tb:tokens:{key}` and `tb:refill:{key}` | Burst tolerance with sustained rate |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 684 Td (| `FIXED_WINDOW` | Counter reset at fixed interval boundaries | Single counter keyed by) Tj (`fw:{key}:{windowBucket}` | Simplicity, lowest Redis overhead |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 640 Td (- Default algorithm is `SLIDING_WINDOW` unless overridden by a matching rule) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 624 Td (- Algorithm name is stored on the `RateLimitRule` entity and loaded per request) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 608 Td (- All three implementations must implement the `RateLimitAlgorithm` interface) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 592 Td (- The correct implementation is resolved at runtime via `RateLimitAlgorithmFactory`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 562 Td (---) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 532 Td (#### FR-1.2 ? Rule evaluation priority) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 516 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 486 Td (Rate limit rules must be evaluated in the following priority order for every incoming) Tj (request:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 442 Td (1. Exact match: `clientId` + `route`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 426 Td (2. Wildcard client: `*` + `route`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 410 Td (3. Global default: `*` + `*`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 394 Td (4. Hard-coded fallback \(if no DB rule exists\): 100 req / 60s / SLIDING_WINDOW) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 364 Td (Rules are cached in Redis under key `rate-limit-rules::{clientId}:{route}` with a 5-minute) Tj (TTL. Cache is invalidated via `@CacheEvict` on any admin rule mutation.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 320 Td (---) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 290 Td (#### FR-1.3 ? Request interception via Spring filter) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 274 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 244 Td (`RateLimitFilter` must extend `OncePerRequestFilter` and execute before any controller) Tj (logic:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 200 Td (```) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 184 Td (Incoming request) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 168 Td (      ?) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 152 Td (Extract clientId \(JWT attribute ? X-Forwarded-For ? remoteAddr\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 136 Td (      ?) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 120 Td (Fetch rule \(Redis cache ? MySQL fallback\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 104 Td (      ?) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 88 Td (Execute algorithm \(Redis atomic operation\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 72 Td (      ?) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 56 Td (ALLOW ? set response headers ? continue filter chain) Tj ET
endstream
