BT /F1 11 Tf 48 776 Td (`POST /api/auth/login` must:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 746 Td (1. Accept `username` and `password` as request parameters) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 730 Td (2. Authenticate via `AuthenticationManager`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 714 Td (3. Return a signed JWT containing:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 698 Td (   - **Subject:** `username` \(used as `clientId` throughout the system\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 682 Td (   - **Claim `role`:** e.g. `ROLE_ADMIN`, `ROLE_CLIENT`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 666 Td (   - **Issued at:** current timestamp) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 650 Td (   - **Expiry:** configurable via `jwt.expiration` \(default 24 hours\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 634 Td (4. Return HTTP 401 on invalid credentials) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 604 Td (Token is signed using HMAC-SHA256 with a secret loaded from `jwt.secret` \(Azure Key Vault in) Tj (production\).) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 560 Td (---) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 530 Td (#### FR-2.2 ? JWT validation on every protected request) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 514 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 484 Td (`JwtAuthFilter` must:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 454 Td (1. Extract the Bearer token from the `Authorization` header) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 438 Td (2. Validate signature, expiry, and structure using `JwtTokenProvider`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 422 Td (3. On success: set `SecurityContextHolder` authentication and store `clientId` as a request) Tj (attribute \(`request.setAttribute\("clientId", subject\)`\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 392 Td (4. On failure: log a warning at DEBUG level and continue the filter chain unauthenticated) Tj (\(Spring Security will reject the request downstream\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 348 Td (Invalid or expired tokens must result in HTTP 401. No token present skips the filter and) Tj (falls through to Spring Security's default rejection for protected routes.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 304 Td (---) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 274 Td (#### FR-2.3 ? Role-based endpoint protection) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 258 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 228 Td (| Endpoint Pattern | Required Role | Notes |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 212 Td (|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 196 Td (| `/api/auth/**` | None \(public\) | Login endpoint |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 180 Td (| `/actuator/**` | None \(public\) | Health and metrics |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 164 Td (| `/api/admin/**` | `ROLE_ADMIN` | Rate limit rule management |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 148 Td (| `/api/otp/**` | `ROLE_CLIENT` or `ROLE_ADMIN` | OTP generate and verify |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 132 Td (| `/api/payments/**` | `ROLE_CLIENT` or `ROLE_ADMIN` | Payment processing |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 102 Td (Unauthorised access returns HTTP 403.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 72 Td (---) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 42 Td (FR-3 OTP Verification) Tj ET
endstream
