BT /F1 11 Tf 48 776 Td (#### FR-3.1 ? OTP generation) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 760 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 730 Td (`POST /api/otp/generate` accepts:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 714 Td (- `identifier` ? phone number \(E.164\) or email address) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 698 Td (- `type` ? enum: `SMS`, `EMAIL`, `WHATSAPP`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 668 Td (Processing steps:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 638 Td (1. Check Redis lockout key `otp:lock:{identifier}` ? reject with HTTP 400 if locked) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 622 Td (2. Generate a cryptographically secure numeric OTP using `SecureRandom` \(length) Tj (configurable, default 6 digits\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 592 Td (3. BCrypt-hash the OTP \(work factor 10\) and persist an `OtpRecord` to MySQL with:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 576 Td (   - `identifier`, `otpType`, `hashedOtp`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 560 Td (   - `expiresAt` = now + `otp.expiry-seconds` \(default 300s\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 544 Td (   - `used = false`, `attempts = 0`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 528 Td (4. Build a `NotificationEvent` with `templateId = "otp_verification"` and dispatch via) Tj (`NotificationDispatcher`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 498 Td (5. Return HTTP 200 with `{"message": "OTP sent successfully"}`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 468 Td (The plaintext OTP is never returned in the API response and never logged.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 438 Td (---) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 408 Td (#### FR-3.2 ? OTP verification) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 392 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 362 Td (`POST /api/otp/verify` accepts: `identifier`, `otp`, `type`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 332 Td (Processing steps:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 302 Td (1. Check Redis lockout key ? return HTTP 400 if locked) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 286 Td (2. Fetch the most recent unused `OtpRecord` for `identifier + type` ordered by `createdAt) Tj (DESC`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 256 Td (3. If none found: HTTP 400 `"No active OTP found"`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 240 Td (4. If `expiresAt` < now: HTTP 400 `"OTP has expired"`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 224 Td (5. Increment `attempts` on the record) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 208 Td (6. If `attempts >= otp.max-attempts` \(default 3\): set Redis lockout key with TTL) Tj (`otp.lockout-seconds` \(default 900\); save record; throw lockout exception) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 178 Td (7. BCrypt compare `otp` against `hashedOtp` ? if mismatch: save incremented attempts, return) Tj (`{"verified": false}`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 148 Td (8. On match: set `used = true`, save record, return `{"verified": true}`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 118 Td (---) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 88 Td (#### FR-3.3 ? OTP configuration) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 72 Td (**Priority:** P1 ? Should Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 42 Td (All OTP behaviour must be driven by externally configurable properties:) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
