BT /F1 11 Tf 48 776 Td (| Property | Default | Description |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 760 Td (|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 744 Td (| `otp.length` | `6` | Number of digits in generated OTP |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 728 Td (| `otp.expiry-seconds` | `300` | OTP validity window \(5 minutes\) |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 712 Td (| `otp.max-attempts` | `3` | Failed attempts before lockout |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 696 Td (| `otp.lockout-seconds` | `900` | Account lockout duration \(15 minutes\) |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 666 Td (Changes take effect on next application restart \(no live reload required for security policy) Tj (changes\).) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 622 Td (---) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 592 Td (FR-4 Payment Processing) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 563 Td (#### FR-4.1 ? Idempotent payment creation) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 547 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 517 Td (`POST /api/payments` accepts:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 501 Td (- Header: `Idempotency-Key` \(UUID, required\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 485 Td (- Params: `amount` \(positive BigDecimal\), `currency` \(3-char ISO\), `description` \(optional\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 469 Td (- Auth: JWT required; `clientId` extracted from token subject) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 439 Td (Processing steps:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 409 Td (1. **Redis check:** look up `payment:idem:{idempotencyKey}` ? if found, return the existing) Tj (payment from MySQL without re-processing) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 379 Td (2. **MySQL check:** `paymentRepository.existsByIdempotencyKey\(\)` ? secondary durable guard) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 363 Td (3. If neither exists: create `Payment` record with status `PENDING`, save to MySQL) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 347 Td (4. Call `processWithGateway\(\)` \(pluggable; mock in v1.0\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 331 Td (5. **On success:** update status to `SUCCESS`, set `processedAt`, store idempotency key in) Tj (Redis with 24h TTL, dispatch `payment_success` notification) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 301 Td (6. **On failure:** update status to `FAILED`, store `failureReason`, dispatch) Tj (`payment_failed` notification) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 271 Td (7. Return the final `Payment` entity) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 241 Td (---) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 211 Td (#### FR-4.2 ? Payment status persistence) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 195 Td (**Priority:** P0 ? Must Have) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 165 Td (The `payments` MySQL table must persist:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 135 Td (| Field | Type | Notes |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 119 Td (|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 103 Td (| `id` | BIGINT PK | Auto-generated |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 87 Td (| `idempotencyKey` | VARCHAR UNIQUE | Client-supplied UUID |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 71 Td (| `clientId` | VARCHAR | From JWT subject |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 55 Td (| `amount` | DECIMAL\(12,2\) | Must be > 0 |) Tj ET
